Make your target's diseases burst, doing [68, 92, 110, 125, 139 (TL1-5; SP 100)] blight damage for each disease it is infected with.

This will also spread any diseases to any nearby foes in a radius of [1, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] with a minimum duration of 6.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
